sequenceDiagram
    actor "Flutter Mobile Client" as FlutterMobileClient
    participant "Backend API Host" as BackendAPIHost
    participant "Reading Module" as ReadingModule
    participant "Infrastructure & Persistence" as InfrastructurePersistence
    participant "Engagement Module" as EngagementModule

    activate BackendAPIHost
    FlutterMobileClient->>BackendAPIHost: 1. User submits reading session progress.
    BackendAPIHost-->>FlutterMobileClient: 200 OK with SessionDto
    activate ReadingModule
    BackendAPIHost->>ReadingModule: 2. Dispatch command to log the reading session.
    ReadingModule-->>BackendAPIHost: Result<SessionDto>
    activate InfrastructurePersistence
    ReadingModule->>InfrastructurePersistence: 3. Begin transaction and validate request.
    InfrastructurePersistence-->>ReadingModule: Validation success/failure
    ReadingModule->>InfrastructurePersistence: 4. Create ReadingSession entity and dispatch domain event.
    InfrastructurePersistence-->>ReadingModule: Entity state and event are staged.
    ReadingModule->>InfrastructurePersistence: 5. Commit transaction and publish events.
    InfrastructurePersistence-->>ReadingModule: Commit successful.
    activate EngagementModule
    InfrastructurePersistence->>EngagementModule: 6. Handle ReadingSessionLogged event.
    EngagementModule->>InfrastructurePersistence: 7. Fetch user's active goals.
    InfrastructurePersistence-->>EngagementModule: List<Goal>
    EngagementModule->>EngagementModule: 8. [Loop] Update progress for each goal.
    EngagementModule-->>EngagementModule: Updated Goal entities.
    EngagementModule->>InfrastructurePersistence: 9. Save updated goal progress.
    InfrastructurePersistence-->>EngagementModule: Commit successful.
    FlutterMobileClient->>FlutterMobileClient: 10. Update UI with new session and refresh goal progress.

    note over EngagementModule: CRITICAL IMPLEMENTATION DETAIL: The UpdateGoalProgressOnReadingSessionLoggedHandler must swallow ...
    note over InfrastructurePersistence: The Domain Event Dispatcher pattern is used here. Events are collected on domain entities and dis...

    deactivate EngagementModule
    deactivate InfrastructurePersistence
    deactivate ReadingModule
    deactivate BackendAPIHost
